<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kroger cut from recommended list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kroger cut from recommended list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it removed Kroger Co from its recommended list due to price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- said share had risen 33 percent when it was first recommended by Furman Selz in February 1996.</p>
<p>-- said Kroger's fundamentals remain strong. Said margins have further room to expand.</p>
<p>-- Sees Kroger earning $2.86 a share in 1996 and $3.26 in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Kroger lost 3/4 to 47 in late afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
